  "job_B1.6.2.1_20251001_193252": {
    "text": "Omnia nimia nocent et temperantia mater uirtutum dicitur, \u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc, ealle oferdone \u00feingc deria\u00f0\nSe oferlyfa on \u00e6te & on w\u00e6te de\u00f0 \u00feone man unhalne & his sawle gode l\u00e6\u00f0ette\u00f0 swa swa ure drihten on\nEft \u00fe\u00e6r togeanes ungemetgod f\u00e6sten & to mycel forh\u00e6fdnyss on \u00e6te & on w\u00e6te de\u00f0 \u00feone man unhalne\nEa\u00f0e m\u00e6g se mann findan hu he hine sylfne amyrre ac we sceolan witan \u00fe\u00e6t nan sylfcwala \u00fe\u00e6t is\nNu syndon eahte heafodleahtras \u00fea us onwinna\u00f0 swi\u00f0e.\nAn is gecweden gula, \u00fe\u00e6t is gifernyss on Englisc seo de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man ytt \u00e6r timan & drinc\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e he eft to\nSeo forde\u00f0 \u00e6g\u00f0er ge sawle ge lichaman for\u00feam \u00fee heo maca\u00f0 \u00feam menn mycele untrumnysse & to\nHeo forde\u00f0 eac \u00fea sawle for\u00fean \u00fee he sceal syngian oft \u00feone he sylf nat hu he f\u00e6r\u00f0 for his feondlicum\nSe o\u00f0er leahter is forliger & ungemetgod galnyss se is gehaten fornicatio.\n& he befyl\u00f0 \u00feone mannan & maca\u00f0 of Cristes limum myltestrena lima & of Godes temple gramena\nSe \u00feridda is auaritia, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo yfele gitsung & seo is wyrtruma \u00e6lcere wohnysse.\nHeo gemaca\u00f0 reaflac & unrihte domas, stala & leasunga & forswornysse.\nHeo is helle gelic for\u00feam \u00fee hi habba\u00f0 butu unafylledlice gr\u00e6dignesse \u00fe\u00e6t hi fulle ne beo\u00f0 n\u00e6fre.\nSe feor\u00f0a leahter is ira gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc weamodnyss.\nSe de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se mann nah his modes geweald & maca\u00f0 manslyhtas & mycele yfelu.\nSe fifta is tristitia, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feisre worulde unrotnyss, \u00feonne se mann geunrotsa\u00f0 ealles to swi\u00f0e for his\nTwa unrotnyssa synd, an is \u00feeos yfele, o\u00f0er is halwende \u00fe\u00e6t man for his synnum geunrotsige.\nSe syxta leahter is accidia gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is asolcennyss o\u00f0\u00f0e sl\u00e6w\u00f0 on englisc, \u00feonne \u00feam men ne lyst\nSe seofo\u00fea leahter is iactantia gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is idelgylp on engliscre spr\u00e6ce, \u00feonne se man bi\u00f0 lofgeorn\nSe eahto\u00f0a leahter is superbia gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc modignyss gecweden seo is ord & ende \u00e6lcere\nSeo geworte englas to atolicum deoflum & \u00feone mann maca\u00f0 eac gif he modega\u00f0 to swi\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s deofles\nNu syndon eahta heafodm\u00e6gna \u00fee magon oferswi\u00f0an \u00feas fores\u00e6dan deoflu \u00feurh Drihtnes fultum.\nAn is temperantia, \u00fe\u00e6t is gemetegung on englisc \u00fe\u00e6t man beo gemetegad & to mycel ne \u00feicge on \u00e6te &\nNytenu eta\u00f0 swa \u00e6r swa hi hyt habba\u00f0 ac se gesceadwisa mann sceal cepan his m\u00e6les & \u00feonne hys\nSeo o\u00f0er miht is castitas, \u00fe\u00e6t is cl\u00e6nnyss on englisc, \u00fe\u00e6t se l\u00e6weda hine healde buton forligre on\n\u00feonne bi\u00f0 oferswi\u00f0ed seo galnyss.\nSeo \u00feridde miht is largitas, \u00fe\u00e6t is cystignes on englisc \u00fe\u00e6t man wislice aspende na for woruldgilpe \u00fea\nGod nele \u00fe\u00e6t we beon gr\u00e6dige gitseras ne eac for woruldgilpe forworpan ure \u00e6hta ac d\u00e6lan hi mid\n\u00feonne mage we fordon swa \u00fea deofollican gitsunge.\nSeo feor\u00fee miht is patientia, \u00fe\u00e6t is ge\u00feyld gecweden, \u00fe\u00e6t se man beo ge\u00feyldig & \u00feolmod for Gode &\nSe heofonlica wisdom cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t yrre h\u00e6f\u00f0 wununge on \u00fe\u00e6s dysegan bosme \u00feonne he bi\u00f0 to\nSe fifte miht is spiritalis laetitia, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo gastlice bliss, \u00fe\u00e6t man on God blissige betwux unrotnyssum\n& gif we forleosa\u00f0 \u00feas l\u00e6nan weoruld \u00feing \u00feonne sceole we witan \u00fe\u00e6t ure wunung nis na her ac is on\n\u00feyder we sceolan efstan of \u00feissere earfo\u00f0nysse mid gastlicre blisse.\n\u00feonne bi\u00f0 seo unrotnyss mid ealle oferswi\u00f0ed mid urum ge\u00feylde.\nSeo syxte miht is instantia boni operis, \u00fe\u00e6t is, anr\u00e6dnyss goodes weorces.\nGif we beo\u00f0 anr\u00e6de on goodum weorcum \u00feonne magon we oferswi\u00f0an \u00fea asolcennysse swa for\u00feam \u00fee\nSeo seofo\u00f0e miht is seo so\u00f0e lufu to Gode, \u00fe\u00e6t we on godum weorcum Godes lufe cepan na ideles\nAc uton don \u00e6lmessan swa swa he us t\u00e6hte gode to lofe na us to hlisan \u00fe\u00e6t God sy geherod on urum\nSeo ahto\u00fee miht is seo so\u00f0e eadmodnyss ge to Gode ge to mannum mid modes hluttornysse for\u00feam se\nOn hwam m\u00e6g se mann modigian \u00feeah \u00f0e he wille?\nNe m\u00e6g he on ge\u00feingc\u00f0um for\u00feam \u00fee fela synd ge\u00feungenran.\nNe m\u00e6g he on his \u00e6htum for\u00feam \u00fee he hys ende d\u00e6g nat.\nNe on nanum \u00feingum he ne m\u00e6g modigian gif hi wis bi\u00f0.\nNu ge habba\u00f0 gehyred hu \u00feas halgan m\u00e6gnu oferswi\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00fea leahtras \u00fee deofol bes\u00e6w\u00f0 on us.\n& gif we nella\u00f0 hi oferswi\u00f0an hi besenca\u00f0 us on helle.\nWe magon \u00feurh Godes fultum \u00fea feondlican leahtras mid gecampe oferwinnan gif we cenlice feohta\u00f0\nNu synd twelf abusiua, \u00fe\u00e6t synd twelf un\u00feeawas \u00fea we eow secga\u00f0 on leden & sy\u00f0\u00f0an on englisc.\nDuodecim abusiua sunt seculi. Hoc est, sapiens sine operibus bonis, senex sine religione, adolescens\n\u00fe\u00e6t is gif se wita bi\u00f0 butan goodum weorcum & gif se ealda butan eawf\u00e6stnysse & se welega butan\nNu gif se wita bi\u00f0 butan goodum weorcum se \u00f0e o\u00ferum mannum sceolde syllan gode bysne hu ne bi\u00f0\nNe bi\u00f0 se lareowdom \u00feam l\u00e6wedum fremfull gif se lareow mid weorcum towyrp\u00f0 his bodunge.\nEft gif se lareow dwela\u00f0 hwa bi\u00f0 his lareow sy\u00f0\u00f0an?\n& gif \u00fe\u00e6t eage ablinda\u00f0 ne bi\u00f0 seo hand lociende.\nSe ealda mann \u00fee bi\u00f0 butan eawf\u00e6stnysse bi\u00f0 \u00feam treowe gelic \u00fee leaf byr\u00f0 & blostman & n\u00e6nne\nHw\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00e6fre swa stuntlic swa \u00fe\u00e6t se ealda nelle his mod to Gode awendan mid goodum inngehyde\nIungum mannum m\u00e6g twynian hw\u00e6\u00f0er hi motan libban & se ealda m\u00e6g witan gewiss him \u00feone dea\u00f0.\n\u00f0am ealdun is to warnienne wi\u00f0 \u00fea yfelan ge\u00feohtas for\u00feam \u00fee seo heorte ne ealda\u00f0 ne eac seo tunge\nWite for\u00fei se ealda hw\u00e6t his ylde gedafenige & \u00fea \u00feing forseo \u00fee his sawle deria\u00f0.\nSe \u00feridda un\u00feeaw is on \u00feissere worulde \u00fe\u00e6t se iunga mann beo butan gehyrsumnysse.\nUnwyr\u00f0e bi\u00f0 se on ylde \u00fe\u00e6t him o\u00f0re menn \u00feenion se \u00fee on iugu\u00f0e nele his yldrum gehyrsumian.\nUre H\u00e6lend on his iugo\u00f0e w\u00e6s gehyrsum his magon & his heofonlican f\u00e6der he gehyrsumode o\u00f0\nSwa swa \u00feam ealdan gedafenia\u00f0 dugende \u00feeawas & geripod syfernyss swa gerist \u00feam iungan \u00fe\u00e6t he\nGodes \u00e6 byt eac \u00fe\u00e6t man arwur\u00feige symble hys f\u00e6der & modor mid mycelre under\u00feeodnysse & gif\nSe feor\u00fea un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se welega mann beo butan \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum & bediglige hys feoh & geornlice\nUnges\u00e6lig bi\u00f0 se gitsere \u00fee \u00feurh hys ges\u00e6l\u00fea losa\u00f0 & for \u00feam gewitendlicum \u00feingum forwyr\u00f0 a on\nAnd ges\u00e6lige beo\u00f0 symle \u00fea mildheortan for\u00feam \u00fee hi gemeta\u00f0 \u00fea mildheortnysse eft.\nSe \u00fee d\u00e6l\u00f0 \u00e6lmyssan for his Drihtnes lufan se behyt his goldhord on heofonan rice \u00fe\u00e6r nan scea\u00f0a ne\nOn manegum wisum man m\u00e6g wyrcan \u00e6lmyssan on \u00e6te & on w\u00e6te & on gew\u00e6dum eac & on\nEall \u00feis bi\u00f0 \u00e6lmysse & eac \u00fe\u00e6t man beswinge \u00feone stuntan for steore se \u00fee styran sceal for\u00feam \u00fee he\nNe licge on \u00feinum horde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feam hafenleasan m\u00e6ge fremian to bigwiste for\u00feam \u00fee \u00feu ne brycst ana\n\u00feu gaderast ma & ma & menn cwela\u00f0 hungre & \u00feine welan forrotia\u00f0 \u00e6tforan \u00feinum eagum.\nDo\u00f0 swa swa drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0, d\u00e6la\u00f0 \u00e6lmyssan & ealle \u00feing eow beo\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne, \u00feis he cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his\nSe fifta un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t wif beo unsydefull.\nUnsydefulnys bi\u00f0 sceamu for worulde & \u00fe\u00e6t unsydefulle wif bi\u00f0 unwur\u00f0 on life & eft \u00e6fter life nan\nWisdom gerist werum & wifum for\u00feam seo sidefulnyss gescylt hi wi\u00f0 un\u00feeawas.\n\u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r seo sidefulnyss bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 eac seo cl\u00e6nnyss & \u00fe\u00e6t sidefulle wif onscuna\u00f0 gitsunge & ceaste\nHeo hi warna\u00f0 wi\u00f0 druncennysse & wordlunge ne lufa\u00f0.\nwitodlice se sidefulnyss gewylt ealle un\u00feeawas & goode \u00feeawas heo hylt \u00fee gode licia\u00f0 & mannum.\nSeo syxta un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00f0e to hlaforde bi\u00f0 geset \u00fe\u00e6t he for modleaste ne m\u00e6ge his mannum don\nSume hlafordas geneal\u00e6ca\u00f0 \u00feurh heora hlafordscipe to Gode swa Moyses se arwur\u00f0a \u00fee to \u00fe\u00e6m\nSe hlaford sceal beon li\u00f0e \u00feam goodum & egefull \u00feam dysegum \u00fe\u00e6t he heora dysig alecge & he sceal\nElles ne bi\u00f0 his gefadung ne f\u00e6st ne langsum.\nHe sceal beon swa geworht \u00fe\u00e6t him man mote wi\u00f0 sprecan & swa hw\u00e6t swa he wrece wrece for\nHyt is awriten on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 eall swa scyldig se \u00fee yfel ge\u00feafa\u00f0 swa swa \u00fee \u00f0e hyt de\u00f0 gyf he\nHe sceal hyne ge\u00feeodan mid \u00feeawf\u00e6stnysse to Gode for\u00feam \u00fee he nane mihte habban ne m\u00e6g to rihte\nSe hlaford sceal hogian \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe Godes fultum & he ortruwian ne sceal ahw\u00e6r be Godes fultume.\nGif God bi\u00f0 his gefylsta ne bi\u00f0 his miht forsewen for\u00feam \u00fee nan miht nis butan of Gode se\u00f0e ahef\u00f0 of\nHe awyrp\u00f0 \u00fea modigan of heora mihtesetle & ahef\u00f0 \u00fea eadmodan \u00fe\u00e6t eall middaneard beo Gode\nSe seofo\u00fea un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se cristena mann beo sacfull.\nOf cristes naman is cristianus gecweden, \u00fe\u00e6t is se cristena mann \u00fee on criste is gefullod.\nGif he \u00feonne bi\u00f0 sacfull ne bi\u00f0 he so\u00f0lice cristen.\nNis nan man rihtlice cristen butan se \u00f0e Criste geefenl\u00e6c\u00f0.\nCrist sylf nolde flitan swa swa his f\u00e6der cw\u00e6\u00f0 be hym, Efne her is min cild \u00fee me is swi\u00f0e leof & ic\nNe flit he mid ceaste ne sace ne astyre\u00f0 ne on str\u00e6tum ne gehyr\u00f0 \u00e6nig mann hys stemne.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac on his godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea beo\u00f0 Godes bearn \u00fea \u00fee gesibsume beo\u00f0 & sace ne astyria\u00f0.\nSwa swa \u00fea gesibbsuman beo\u00f0 so\u00f0lice Godes bearn swa beo\u00f0 \u00fea eac sacfullan deofles bearn.\nEalle we clypia\u00f0 to Gode & cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, pater noster, \u00feu ure f\u00e6der \u00fee eart on heofenum.\nAc we ne magon habban \u00feone heofonlican e\u00feel buton we fram eallum sacum orsorge beon.\nSe eahto\u00f0a un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00feearfa beo modig.\nMenig mann n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00e6hta & h\u00e6f\u00f0 modignysse swa \u00feeah & is earm for worulde & unges\u00e6lig for Gode\nCrist cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle be \u00feam gastlican \u00feearfum, Beati pauperes spiritu quoniam ipsorum est\n\u00fea beo\u00f0 \u00feearfan on gaste \u00fea \u00fee for Godes lufan beo\u00f0 eadmode for\u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s modes eadmodnyss\nWitodlice \u00fea rican \u00fee rihtlice libba\u00f0 magon beon getealde betwux Godes \u00feearfum gif hi eadmodnysse\nSe modiga \u00feearfa for his modes upahefednysse is to rican geteald rihtlice on bocum & se eadmoda\nSe nigo\u00fea un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se cyning beo unrihtwis.\nSe cyning bi\u00f0 gecoren to \u00feam \u00fee him cy\u00f0 his nama.\nRex we cwe\u00fea\u00f0 cyning, \u00fe\u00e6t is gecweden wissigend, for\u00feam \u00fee he sceal wissigan mid wisdome his\n\u00fe\u00e6s cyninges rihtwisnyss ar\u00e6r\u00f0 his cynesetl & \u00fe\u00e6s folces steore gesta\u00feela\u00f0 his so\u00f0f\u00e6stnyss.\n\u00fe\u00e6t is cyninges rihtwisnyss \u00fe\u00e6t he mid riccetere ne ofsitte ne earmne ne eadigne ac \u00e6lcum deme riht.\nHe sceal beon bewergend wydewena & steopcilda & stala alecgan & forliger gewitnian & \u00fea arleasan\nWitan hym sceolan r\u00e6dan & he ne sceal beon weamod.\nGodes mynstra he sceal mundian \u00e6fre & fedan \u00feearfan & f\u00e6stlice winnan wi\u00f0 onsigendne here &\nHe sceal so\u00f0f\u00e6ste menn settan hym to gerefan & for Gode lybban hys lif rihtlice & beon on\nHe sceal hyne gebiddan on asettum tidum & \u00e6r m\u00e6ltidum metes ne abitan.\nFor\u00feam \u00fee hit is awriten \u00fe\u00e6t wa \u00fe\u00e6re leode \u00fear se cining bi\u00f0 cild & \u00fear \u00fea ealdormenn eta\u00f0 on\nGif se cyning wile mid carfulnysse healdan \u00feas fores\u00e6dan beboda \u00feonne by\u00f0 his rice gesundfull on\nGif he \u00feonne forsyh\u00f0 \u00feas gesetnyssa & lare \u00feonne by\u00f0 his eard geyrmed for oft \u00e6g\u00f0er ge on\nWite eac se cyning hu hyt is geweden on bocum gif he rihtwisnysse ne hylt \u00fe\u00e6t swa swa he ahafan is\nSe teo\u00f0a un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se bisceop beo gymeleas.\nEpiscopus is grecisc nama \u00fe\u00e6t is on leden speculator & on englisc sceawere for\u00feam \u00fee he is geset to\nGif \u00feu \u00feam arleasan nelt hys arleasnysse secgan \u00feonne swylt se arleasa on his arleasnysse & ic\nGif \u00feu \u00feonne warnast \u00feone arleasan wer & he nelle gecyrran fram his synnum \u00feurh \u00fee he swylt on hys\nGif se bisceop bi\u00f0 gymeleas \u00feonne he Godes bydel is & to lareowe geset \u00feam l\u00e6wedum folce \u00feonne\nSe endlyfta un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t folc beo butan steore.\nFela beo\u00f0 stuntnyssa \u00fe\u00e6r nan steor ne bi\u00f0 & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t dysig bi\u00f0 orsorh & \u00fe\u00e6t gedwyld ricsa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0\nBe \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 se sealmwyrhta \u00feisum wordum clypiende, Adprehendite disciplinam ne quando\nEac Paulus se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his pistole, \u00feurhwunia\u00f0 on steore & gewitodlice beo\u00f0 swylce\nEft se witega Isaias be \u00feam ilcan cw\u00e6\u00f0, Quiescite agere peruerse discite, bene facere, Geswica\u00f0\nDauid cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac, Declina a malo & fac bonum, Buh fram yfele & do good.\nGif \u00feu unsce\u00f0\u00f0ig si gescyld \u00fee wi\u00f0 yfel & gif \u00feu sce\u00f0\u00f0ig w\u00e6re gewend \u00fee fram yfele \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00fee \u00feu\nSe twelfta un\u00feeaw is \u00fe\u00e6t folc beo butan \u00e6 we ne moton nu healdan Moyses \u00e6 on \u00fea ealdan wisan\nManega wegas synd swa swa se wisdom clypa\u00f0.\n\u00fee mannum \u00feinga\u00f0 rihte ac hi swa \u00feeah gel\u00e6da\u00f0 to dea\u00f0e on ende \u00fea \u00fee hym dyslice folgia\u00f0.\nSe \u00fee Godes \u00e6 forl\u00e6t seo \u00fee is ure weg se sceal mislice faran on manegum gedwyldum.\nCrist sylf is se weg swa swa he s\u00e6de be hym, Ego sum uia & ueritas & uita, Ic sylf eom se weg &\nAc we beo\u00f0 \u00feurh Crist to heofenum gebrohte gif we his biggengas healda\u00f0.\n\u00f0a \u00fee butan Godes \u00e6 & Godes gesetnyssum libba\u00f0 \u00fea beo\u00f0 butan Gode \u00e6fre wunigende.\nDrihten sylf behet \u00feis \u00feam \u00fee healda\u00f0 hys beboda, Ecce ego uobiscum sum omnibus diebus usque ad\nSe H\u00e6lend us gewissige to hys willan symble \u00fe\u00e6t ure sawla moton si\u00f0ian eft to him \u00e6fter urum life to\nSy him a wuldor & wur\u00f0mynt Amen.",
